note Prime numbers in Jesun.Code: nested loops and a helper.

to is_prime with n
    if n is less than 2 then
        give back false
    d is 2
    repeat while d * d is at most n
        if n % d is 0 then
            give back false
        d is d + 1
    give back true

found is []
n is 2
repeat while length of found is less than 10
    if is_prime with n then
        push n to found
    n is n + 1
show "first ten primes: {found}"
